    "conversations": [
      {
        "id": "mai",
        "lines": [
          "MaiChào buổi sáng! Pull",
          "MaiAh, cà phê and old facades — gu của bạn hay lắm! From our alley, stroll Lê Lợi to Nguyễn Huệ to see Tòa Thị Chính and its statue, then the Opera House. Mời bạn ngồi, and later grab a postcard at the Post Office near Nhà thờ Đức Bà."
        ],
        "source": "Live NPC conversation"
      },
      {
        "id": "alex",
        "lines": [
          "AlexChào buổi sáng! Beautiful light on the Opera House today, right? Look at how the morning sun hits those columns — what detail catches your eye first?",
          "AlexOh, cùng sở thích! For architecture, notice the arches and little carvings under the Opera House eaves. Wander Đồng Khởi for shop facades, then the cathedral and Post Office square — đẹp lắm with a coffee in hand!"
        ],
        "source": "Live NPC conversation"
      }
    ]
  },
